{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two worlds:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nav\u0101</strong> \u2014 a realm of boundless magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/4_59_Nova_l_1_1.png?t=1740239953\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terra</strong> \u2014 a marvel of cutting-edge technology.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/9_iris_101_1_1.png?t=1740239953\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For centuries, these realms existed apart, unaware of each other. But now, their borders are crumbling, and whispers of chaos spread. Greedy leaders from both sides see only opportunity\u2014magic to steal, machines to exploit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/7_gate_34_1_1.png?t=1740239953\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you side with <strong><i>The Extinctionists</i></strong>, who demand one world\u2019s dominance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/z_6_kali_1_1.png?t=1740239953\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or <strong><i>The Expansionists</i></strong>, who dream of unity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/9_iris_40_1_1.png?t=1740239953\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or forge your own path, torn between love, vengeance, and duty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/cover_art_4.png?t=1740239953\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3318110?t=1740239953","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3318110?t=1740239953","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/c3ab4dfe2f13d6e1831d71544800b99baf90667a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740239953","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/c3ab4dfe2f13d6e1831d71544800b99baf90667a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740239953","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"This game is for adults only. All characters engaging in sexual or roleplay scenes, including light BDSM activity, are at least 18 years old, and all sexual acts are consensual.\r\n\r\nWhile not the main focus of the story, The Last Star Walker includes realistic, non-glamorized depictions of drug and alcohol abuse, physical abuse, trauma, bullying, violence, and subtle elements of self-harm, along with their impact on those involved."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two worlds:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nav\u0101</strong> \u2014 a realm of boundless magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/4_59_Nova_l_1_1.png?t=1740239953\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terra</strong> \u2014 a marvel of cutting-edge technology.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/9_iris_101_1_1.png?t=1740239953\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For centuries, these realms existed apart, unaware of each other. But now, their borders are crumbling, and whispers of chaos spread. Greedy leaders from both sides see only opportunity\u2014magic to steal, machines to exploit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"b